#: kio_smb.cpp:2191 kio_smb.cpp:2242 kio_smb.cpp:2275
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure that the samba package is installed properly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Osigurajte da je samba paket instaliran na vašem sistemu."

#: kio_smb.cpp:289
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is probably no SMB service running on this host."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Vjerovatno SMB servis nije pokrenut na ovom računaru."

#: kio_smb.cpp:308 kio_smb.cpp:313
msgid ""
"\n"
"Invalid user/password combination."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Neispravna kombinacija korisničkog imena/šifre."

#: kio_smb.cpp:332
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Hmm..."

#: kio_smb.cpp:484
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

#: kio_smb.cpp:488
msgid "Workgroup"
msgstr "Radna grupa"

#: kio_smb.cpp:493
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Share"

#: kio_smb.cpp:724
msgid ""
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
"To get a list of all hosts use lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"See the KDE Control Center under Network, LANBrowsing for more information."
msgstr ""
"Da bi pristupili datotekama sa drugog servera, koristite smb://hostname\n"
"Listu svih računara možete dobiti koristeći lan:/ ili rlan:/ .\n"
"Za više informacija pogledate KDE Kontrolni Centar > Mreža > LANBrowsing"

#: kio_smb.cpp:1164
msgid ""
"\n"
"To access the shares of a host, use smb://hostname\n"
"To get a list of all hosts use lan:/ or rlan:/ .\n"
"See the KDE Control Center under Network, LANBrowsing for more information."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Da bi pristupili datotekama sa drugog servera, koristite smb://hostname\n"
"Listu svih računara možete dobiti koristeći lan:/ ili rlan:/ .\n"
"Za više informacija pogledate KDE Kontrolni Centar > Mreža > LANBrowsing"

#: kio_smb.cpp:1202 kio_smb.cpp:1251 kio_smb.cpp:1375 kio_smb.cpp:1406
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Could not create required pipe %1."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ne mogu kreirati zahtjevani pipe %1."

#: kio_smb.cpp:1238
msgid ""
"To be able to write to a remote Samba share you must patch and recompile "
"smbclient.\n"
"Visit http://lisa-home.sourceforge.net/smbclientpatch.html and follow the "
"instructions there."
msgstr ""
"Da biste mogli pisati na udaljeni Samba share morate patch-irati i ponovo "
"kompajlirati smbclient.\n"
"Posjetite http://lisa-home.sourceforge.net/smbclientpatch.html i pratite "
"instrukcije."

#: kio_smb.cpp:1261 kio_smb.cpp:1269 kio_smb.cpp:1417 kio_smb.cpp:1425
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Could not fcntl() pipe %1."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ne mogu fcntl() pipe %1 ."

